q("ag-007", B, 2, GA, "Water drops form on the outside of a cold glass of ice water. Which gas in the air formed these drops?", "Water vapour", [W("Oxygen", "wrong-gas", "Oxygen stays as a gas on the cold glass."), W("Nitrogen", "wrong-gas", "Nitrogen stays as a gas on the cold glass."), W("Carbon dioxide", "wrong-gas", "Carbon dioxide does not turn into water.")], ["Water vapour in the air cools and turns into drops of water on the cold glass."], None)
