q("ag-012", B, 1, GA, "The pie chart shows the gases in air. Which slice stands for oxygen?", "Q", [W("P", "wrong-slice", "P is the biggest slice. Oxygen is not the most plentiful gas."), W("R", "wrong-slice", "R is far smaller than the amount of oxygen."), W("P and R together", "wrong-idea", "Oxygen is one gas and has one slice.")], ["Oxygen is about 21%, the second biggest slice."], PIE3)
